    <li><strong>Screen + camera recording</strong> - Show your face in a circle while sharing screen</li>
    <li><strong>Instant shareable links</strong> - No downloads needed for viewers</li>
    <li><strong>Comments and reactions</strong> - Viewers can leave timestamped comments</li>
    <li><strong>Fast and lightweight</strong> - Records and uploads instantly</li>
  </ul>

  <h4>What Could Be Better</h4>
  <ul>
